	(text "MCU module (Rev A) - design notes\n\nRaytac MDBT53-P1M (nRF5340, PCB antenna), Ver.E 2024-10-25, reference circuit 8.1.2 (normal voltage, DC/DC):\nVDD = VDDH = 3V3 with 4.7 uF (C401); DCCH not connected; DCC-L401-DECR and DCCD-L402-DECD with 1 uF each.\nModule VBUS (pin 44) through 2.2 ohm (R401) with 4.7 uF (C402); the charger branch does not pass through R401.\nUSB D+/D- via 0 ohm links R402/R403 from the TPD4E05U06 (charger sheet); 27 ohm footprint option per Raytac figure.\nLFXO: CM7V-T1A 9 pF on XL1/XL2 (P0.00/P0.01) with the nRF5340 internal 9 pF load; C405/C406 DNP.\nNFC1/NFC2 pins used as spare GPIO (CONFIG_NFCT_PINS_AS_GPIOS); native NFC unused.\nSpare GPIO P0.02/03/13/14/26/27 go to debug-sheet pads; P0.07/15/16/17/18/28 unconnected.\nAntenna: keep the Raytac keep-out (all layers) clear of copper, battery, magnets and screws.\nPin map: IMPLEMENTATION DECISION, verified against the project symbol (Ver.E 2.5). Nothing measured."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
